&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate our AWS-based cloud platform with a focus on stability, scalability and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and optimize our Kubernetes/EKS environment, including namespaces, RBAC, ResourceQuotas and NetworkPolicies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reusable CI/CD components, especially with GitLab CI/CD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design GitOps-based deployment processes using Flux, Helm and Kustomize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate infrastructure and AWS resources with Terraform and Crossplane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage secrets and sensitive configuration securely, for example with SOPS and AWS KMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve monitoring, alerting and observability with Prometheus, Grafana and OpenSearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and resolve issues across CI/CD, Kubernetes, GitOps and cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable development and project teams to manage deployments, platform usage and CI/CD processes independently&lt;/li&gt;
